config NRFMODULE_ADV_CODEC
	bool "nRFModule BLE advertising wire-format codec"
	help
	  Pure encode/decode for the company-0x0E34 BLE advertising layouts
	  (nRFModule tracker v2 status broadcast, BeeScales hive-scale scan
	  response) plus the Ingics iBS05 temperature beacon (company 0x082C).
	  A single classify/decode entry point disambiguates the two 0x0E34
	  layouts from each other. No Bluetooth stack dependency: any product
	  that needs to read or write these payloads can enable it, including
	  a future BLE hub that scans mixed advertisers.
